<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hannaford started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Meredith Adler said she initiated coverage of Hannaford Bros Co with a neutral rating and a one-year price target of $36.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Hannaford has chosen a risky strategy for growth by simultaneously entering seven fast-growing but highly competitive Southeast markets,&quot; Adler said in a research note. &quot;It is likely to be several years before the company is generating profits in the Southeast.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 31-3/4.</p>
</text>
